<title>USA: Career Horizons acquires staffing company.</title>
<headline>Career Horizons acquires staffing company.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBURY, N.Y. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Career Horizons Inc said Friday it has acquired TSG Professional Services Inc, a Massachusetts company that provides specialty, supplemental staff to the information-technology and health-care industries.</p>
<p>Terms of the cash transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>TSG is a private company based in Stoneham, Mass. It is projected to generate more than $50 million in revenues this year, Career Horizons said.</p>
